<title>ISRAEL: The Israel Corp Q2 net profit soars.</title>
<headline>The Israel Corp Q2 net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Israel Corp Ltd.</p>
<p>			 (In thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			 Q2 96	 Q2 95	6-MTH 96    6-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		776,794     882,672    1,700,896   1,721,688</p>
<p>Pretax profit	 21,630	19,151	 71,700	41,846</p>
<p>Net profit (loss)   11,193	(5,664)	49,186	   372</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
